  "contentHtml": "<p>안녕하세요.</p><p>작년에 이어 올해도&#160;</p><p>청주교사교육포럼을 공동 주관하게 되었습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>저희 &#39;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&#39;에서 세션을 운영합니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/74892ccf40ae3107bdd733c73a425281d0063b35\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/74892ccf40ae3107bdd733c73a425281d0063b35\" data-origin-width=\"1118\" data-origin-height=\"266\"></div><p>1.11~1.13까지&#160;</p><p>다양한 세션들이 준비되어 있습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9f8d9444d989e4d6a5a7fa34d1ef7351487a9785?download\" data-file-name=\"CITEF2021_청주교사교육포럼_학습공동제와교사의성장_안내장(온라인배포용_OPT).pdf\" data-file-size=\"1391872\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3Df7Cv%26dataid%3D24%26fileid%3D2%26regdt%3D20211208133749&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F9f8d9444d989e4d6a5a7fa34d1ef7351487a9785')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">CITEF2021_청주교사교육포럼_학습공동제와교사의성장_안내장(온라인배포용_OPT)</span><span class=\"type\">.pdf</span></div><div class=\"size\">1.33MB</div></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><p>선착순 마감,&#160;</p><p>지금 신청하세요.</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\"><b>신청 접수는 요기 :</b></span></p><p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSc4nrN6BuKtTgmJmNmpV7Q-TXgdA2Ans-fwvRjelmOI4syZkA/viewform\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSc4nrN6BuKtTgmJmNmpV7Q-TXgdA2Ans-fwvRjelmOI4syZkA/viewform</a>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>함께 해주셔서 고맙습니다!</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
